  - `.caption`: Adds basic styles like font size and opacity.
  - `.footer`: Provides a simple footer at the bottom of the page.

This example assumes you want the link to open in a new tab (`target="_blank"`). If you prefer the same window, remove the `target="_blank"` attribute.

Feel free to adjust the colors, fonts, or other elements as needed!
